  "details": "**Steps to reproduce**\n\n1. Create an emoji (static or animated) however necessary (through the website or in-game)\n\n2. Delete the emoji (through the website or in-game)\n\n3. Create an **animated** emoji in its place (through the website or in-game)\n\n4. Go to the VRC+ page **in-game** and inspect the animated emoji to edit it\n\n**Actual result**\n\nThe animated emoji is now animating the previously deleted emoji as if it were a spritesheet. Hitting \"Save\" while editing overwrites the new emoji with the previously deleted one as if it were animated.\n\n**Expected result**\n\nThe user is able to edit the emoji as it is displayed in the VRC+ menu without being replaced by a previously deleted one.",
